{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"肩并肩、呼吸与体温是由“像”引出的比喻，并未断言发生了新的外部事件，而从认真在意、缺乏把握到屏息等待逐渐松动的心理链条也接得成立。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体先于念头放松、暂时感到被托住，是由真实亲近引出的具体局部心理过程，而把握缺口和时间流逝感仍在，因此没有改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“几次温柔的落点……也让心里轻轻发酸”把音乐落点直接写成心理反应的原因，尽管后文已经补出了由认真在意、真实满足和缺乏把握共同形成的不舍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"想把心意说出来被写成了由认真在意、前一条的不舍及情感积累引出的瞬时冲动，而非实际发生的告白，且结尾仍保留悬念，没有替关系作出结论。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了当下感受及其心理成因，H1、H2、H3在文中也有具体释义，第四条与第三条的承接明确，因此不依赖听感记录仍能读懂这段情感变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9edc78dc-ebd9-4481-9c25-e76edf359a4a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T143804973414Z", "elapsed_seconds": 459.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:45:44.324611+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "98d92ccc79d25a2693a102a03a67ff0e9bd1bf8d05a99cd32fac1989d67768a1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicab